# Code owners — auto-assigns review on every PR.
#
# v1.0 ships as a solo-maintainer project. This file exists so:
#   1. Every PR auto-requests review from the maintainer (no missed
#      review-request step on Dependabot PRs).
#   2. When the project grows beyond one maintainer, the right pattern
#      is already in place: add per-area owners (one line per directory
#      with the new owner's handle).
#
# Syntax: <path-pattern>  <owner>...
# Order matters — last matching rule wins.

# Catch-all: every change in the repo is owned by the maintainer.
